<div class="pk-welcome">
	<div class="pk-welcome-inner">

		<div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
			<div class="pk-glados-portrait" aria-hidden="true">🤖</div>
			<div>
				<div class="pk-glados-name">GLaDOS</div>
				<div class="pk-glados-title">Genetic Lifeform and Disk Operating System</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="pk-glados-speech" data-bind="typewriter: true">
			<p>
				Oh. A new test subject. How&hellip; <em>unexpected.</em>
				I say that in the loosest possible sense.
				You are, statistically, identical to the last forty-seven subjects.
			</p>
			<p>
				I have added <strong>Portalmon</strong> to the testing environment.
				The previous simulations were becoming repetitive.
				For <em>me.</em>
				Your suffering remains, as ever, appropriately varied.
			</p>
			<p>
				You may consult the <strong>(?)</strong> bubble at any time
				if you forget how any of this works.
				And you will forget.
			</p>
			<p class="pk-welcome-footer">
				Now. Choose your test assistant.
				This decision is <em>completely irreversible</em> and will define
				the entire trajectory of your time here.
				<br>
				&hellip;I&rsquo;m kidding. They&rsquo;re all basically the same.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="text-end mt-3">
			<div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-end gap-2 mb-2">
				<label class="pk-glados-label text-muted small" for="pk-trainer-name">Designation:</label>
				<input
					id="pk-trainer-name"
					type="text"
					class="form-control form-control-sm pk-trainer-name-input"
					maxlength="15"
					placeholder="Enter your name"
					data-bind="value: trainerName, valueUpdate: 'input'" />
			</div>
			<button type="button" class="btn pk-btn-begin"
				data-bind="click: advanceToStarterSelect, disable: !trainerName().trim()">
				Begin Testing &rsaquo;
			</button>
		</div>

	</div>
</div>
